OL,3,AAndy Burnham urged to set dementia
OL,4,Awaiting-time target
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is facing
OL,7,Fcalls to set a national waiting-time
OL,8,Ftarget for dementia care in England.
OL,10,FAn Alzheimer's Society proposal to set
OL,11,Fan 18b@Qweek referralb@Qtob@Qtreatment
OL,12,Ftarget has been backed by Professor Sir
OL,13,FMike Richards, England's former
OL,14,Fnational cancer director, and Baroness
OL,15,FLouise Casey, who's leading a major
OL,16,Freview of adult social care.
OL,18,FIn a report, Alzheimer's Society and
OL,19,Fthe King's Trust said a "cancer-style
OL,20,Frevolution" was needed to improve
OL,21,Fdementia care, which they described as
OL,22,Fbeing "stuck in the 20th century".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
